de la bater\u00eda: aproximadamente 50% en 30 minutos<\/li><li>Reproducci\u00f3n del v\u00eddeo sobre la duraci\u00f3n m\u00e1xima de la bater\u00eda<\/li><li>Hasta 8 horas y 45 minutos<\/li><li><b>Interfaz de red<\/b><\/li><li>LAN 10\/100\/1000 GbE integrada<\/li><li><b>Conectividad inal\u00e1mbrica<\/b><\/li><li>Combo Mediatek Wi-Fi 6 MT7921 (2x2) y Bluetooth\u00ae 5.2 (soporta velocidad de datos Gigabit)<\/li><li>Compatible con MU-MIMO<\/li><li><b>Puertos<\/b><\/li><ul><li>1 SuperSpeed USB Type-C\u00ae con velocidad de se\u00f1al de 5 Gbps (suministro de energ\u00eda por USB, DisplayPort&#8482; 1.4, HP Sleep and Charge);<\/li><li>1 SuperSpeed USB Type-A con velocidad de se\u00f1al de 5 Gbps (HP Sleep and Charge);\u00a0<\/li><li>2 SuperSpeed USB Type-A con velocidad de se\u00f1al de 5 Gbps;\u00a0<\/li><li>1 HDMI 2.1;\u00a0<\/li><li>1 RJ-45;\u00a0<\/li><li>1 smart pin de CA;\u00a0<\/li><li>1 combo de auriculares\/micr\u00f3fono<\/li><\/ul><li><b>Ranuras de expansi\u00f3n<\/b><\/li><li>Lector de tarjetas SD multiformato HP<\/li><li><b>C\u00e1mara web<\/b><\/li><li>C\u00e1mara HP Wide Vision 720p HD con reducci\u00f3n de ruido temporal y micr\u00f3fonos digitales de matriz dual integrados<\/li><li><b>Color del producto<\/b><\/li><li>Plata mica, logotipo cromado oscuro<\/li><li>Acabado con pintura<\/li><li><b>Peso<\/b><\/li><li>2.48 kg;<\/li><li><b><span style='background-color: initial;'>Dimensiones<\/span><br><\/b><\/li><li>37 x 26 x 2,35 cm;<\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><\/div>                                            ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"HP","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":3.67,"unit_price":919.8,"unit_price_tax":919.8,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Portatiles","